@startuml
[*] --> NotLoggedIn
NotLoggedIn:
    --> Register: Register
    --> Login: Login
NotLoggedIn -> AccessDenied: if Registration Fails
AccessDenied --> [*]

LoggedIn:
    --> ViewNewsExpertContent: Read News/Expert Content
    --> CheckSymptomsFitness: Check Symptoms/Fitness
    --> SelectPaymentMethod: Payment Options
LoggedIn --> SessionEnded: Logout

InsuranceValidated --> ProcessPayment: Process Insurance Payment
ProcessPayment --> FeedbackCollection: Continue or Finish
FeedbackCollected --> [*]

DrugSupplement:
    --> CashPaymentDetails: Cash Payment
    --> InsuranceBasedPayment: Insurance Payment
DrugSupplement --> FeedbackCollection

CheckSymptomsFitness --> DoctorConsultation: Consult Doctor
DoctorConsultation --> PaymentProcessing: Process Payment
PaymentProcessing --> FeedbackCollection

ViewNewsExpertContent --> SessionEnded: Finish Session
@enduml
